39,"name":"change_scene","args":[3,65535,65535,65535,5]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&邓艾\n（这两个家伙想让我当代罪羔羊，可没\n这么容易。）\n&陈造\n嘿嘿嘿…反正这个城大概也守不住，就让\n那个笨结巴去扛这个责任。\n&万政\n陈造脑袋还真不赖，这样我们就算丢了\n这座城，也不会被怪罪。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n敌人城外布置两支部队，如果在正面攻城\n时遭到两面包夹会很麻烦。\n&陈式\n…（指向中间）\n&姜维\n确实如果兵力往两边分散，则敌人又会\n从中突破。\n&句扶\n使用诱敌之计如何？我负责引诱来自上面\n的敌人。\n&柳隐\n那么下面的任务就交给我吧。\n&杨兰\n好像闻到类似燃油的味道…莫非敌人想用\n火攻？\n&宁随\n只要我们加快进城的脚步，打倒敌人主将\n应该可以阻止火攻。只是…\n&姜维\n只是什么？\n&宁随\n总觉得这些计谋太过单纯，既没有联系感\n，也没有任何补救措施，彷彿被我们识破\n也无所谓。\n&宁随\n守这个城的家伙如果不是个白痴，就是个\n可怕的谋将。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[108]},{"op":25,"name":"victory_cond_text","args":["胜利条件\n一、歼灭所有敌军。\n\n失败条件\n一、陈式撤退。\n二、回合数超过25。"]},{"op":26,"name":"battle_goal_text","args":["一、歼灭所有敌军。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["印绶条件\n触发所有单挑。\n"]},{"op":90,"name":"ui_5a","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_result","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":1,"offset":11532,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":11534,"title":"ね瓁北��","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["ね瓁北��"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[1,0]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,0,2,0,7]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,240,32]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":1,"offset":11619,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":38,"name":"test_unit_in_area","args":[4,9,3,13,5]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[97,112]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,4,0,13,2,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[4,7,1,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&句扶\n废物快快过来受死！\n&陈造\n我是废物？！"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[91,65535,1,0,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&陈造\n我像吗？\n&轻骑兵4\n（点头。）\n&陈造\n太可恶了！我最恨人家说我废物！\n弟兄们给我冲！"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[91,65535,3,0,0,0]},{"op":78,"name":"unit_op_4e","args":[1,65535,15,0,19,4,2,1,65535,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&句扶\n没想到随便说说居然效果这么好。"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,4,0,9,9,1]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[97,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":2,"offset":12076,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":38,"name":"test_unit_in_area","args":[3,9,16,13,19]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[98,113]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,3,0,13,21,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[3,5,1,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&柳隐\n这位老兄一直站在那里不闷吗？不如来\n追我吧。\n&万政\n笑话，老子外号“不动之万政”，说不动\n就是不动。\n&柳隐\n这样…"]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[3,6,1,1]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[92,3,1,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&万政\n居然敢射我最得意的头盔…啊…我的…\n“阿马泥”！\n&万政\n那可是从大秦国进口的宝贝！可恶啊！\n&万政\n给我宰了他！"]},{"op":78,"name":"unit_op_4e","args":[1,65535,13,18,20,23,2,1,65535,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,3,0,9,14,1]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[98,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":12576,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[12,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[120,102,114,1007]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&邓艾\n（那么就用这些火焰作为送给你们的\n见面礼，再会了。）"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,104,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[0,0,16,15,7,0,0]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[0,0,16,16,7,0,0]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[0,0,16,17,7,0,0]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[0,0,16,18,7,0,0]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[0,0,16,19,7,0,0]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","